<p>ABBAS ASWS. KI BEHEN HUN KOI SONCHTA NAHI.</p>

<p>HUM AALE MUSTAFA HAIN KOI BOLTA NAHI.</p>

<p>
1. KARBOBALA MEIN SHAM KE ZINDAA'N SE AAYI HUN.</p>

<p>POOCHO NA KYA KYA DAAGH MAIN DIL PAR UTHAYI HUN.</p>

<p>KURTA LAHOO BHARA HUA PYASE KA LAAYI HUN.</p>

<p>
2. AKBAR ASWS. NAHI HAIN QASIM O ASGHAR ASWS. NAHI HAI MAA.</p>

<p>BACHE HAMARE GODH KE MAQTAL MEIN HAI NIHAA'N.</p>

<p>MAQTAL KI SAR ZAMEE'N SE MAIN SOUGHAAT LAAYI HUN.</p>

<p>
3. HUM AALE MUSTAFA SAWW. HAI KOI SONCHTA NA THA.</p>

<p>ABBAS ASWS. KI BEHEN HUN KOI SONCHTA NA THA.</p>

<p>BAZARE SHAAM ME WO MUSEEBAT UTHAYI HUN.</p>

<p>
4. BALI SAKINA S.A. SHAAM KE ZINDAA'N MEIN REH GAYI.</p>

<p>POOCHO NA KYA KYA DAAGH WO BIBI BHI SEH GAYI.</p>

<p>ABID ASWS. GHAREEB KO MAI MERE SAATH LAAYI HUN..</p>

<p>5. AMMA TUMHARI BETI PE KYA KYA SITAM HUE.</p>

<p>DARBAR MEIN YAZEED L.A. KE HUM NANGE SAR HUE.</p>

<p>BETI ALI ASWS. KI FATIMA ZEHRA S.A. KI JAAYI HUN.</p>

<p>
6. BHAYI KA DAAGH LEKE RASAN BASTA AAYI HAIN.</p>

<p>AMMA TUMHARI LAADLI KUFE SE AAYI HAIN.</p>

<p>KARBOBALA KE BAN MEIN MAIN BASTI BASAYI HUN.</p>

<p>
7. MATAM YEH AAJ ANJUMAN E ASGHARI KA HAIN.</p>

<p>IQBAL NAUHA PYAS PE HAI BEKASI KA HAI.</p>

<p>BHAYI KA NOUHA SUNNE MAIN MAJLIS MEIN AAYI HUN..</p>

<p>
<center><h4>Kalaam: JANAB IQBAL ABIDI SAHAB.</h4></center></p>
